<title>PAKISTAN: Hockey-Golden Jubilee standings.</title>
<headline>Hockey-Golden Jubilee standings.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings after the third day of the Golden Jubilee of Pakistan men's hockey tournament at the Hockey Club of Pakistan on Tuesday were: </p>
<p>					    P  W  D  L  F  A  PTS</p>
<p> Germany				  2  2  0  0  4  1  6</p>
<p> Netherlands			    2  1  1  0  6  5  4</p>
<p> Pakistan				 2  0  2  0  4  4  2</p>
<p> England				  2  0  1  1  1  3  1</p>
<p> Australia				2  0  0  2  3  5  0</p>
</text>
